{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFD\\,#FAF2F9)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A191E\\,#221D26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{nm.y}+({nm.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色身份点(组件设计系统 §2):每个组件恰好一次,y 锚在组件名的实测框上。"
      },
      {
        "id": "nm",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "220pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${p},${@i18n.noPkg})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${endM},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "数据时间锚 = 数据截至日(MM-DD),不是取数时刻 —— 三个源都滞后 1~4 天,写取数时刻是在骗人。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasV},1),if::(eq::(${hasR},1),if::(eq::(${relToday},1),0,1),0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "subA",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "33pt",
            "w": "310pt",
